scenario a new visitor after the budget is spent gets the floor, not darkness
boot
within 9 state == DARK_IDLE
hand 1
wait 40
hand 0
within 6 state == DARK_IDLE
remember remaining
wait 5
hand 1
within 1.5 level == floor
wait 3
expect level == floor
expect state == LIT
expect remaining < @remaining  # the floor still costs the bat
